<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T said cut by J P Morgan.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T said cut by J P Morgan.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan cut its estimate on AT&amp;T Corp's 1997 earnings to $3.40 per share from $3.60, market sources said.</p>
</text>
